<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo stock exchange closed for Easter holiday.</title>
<headline>Colombo stock exchange closed for Easter holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange was closed for trading due to Good Friday holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the all share index closed 0.91 points up at 636.86 on buying by foreign and local investors.</p>
